        "content": "### Read this dashboard honestly\n- **Engine must be fak-native.** No query silently falls back to llama.cpp; engine/model identity stays visible.\n- **Qwen3.8 is the default evidence model.** Change the model variable only for an explicit regression, compatibility, historical, or hardware/artifact exception.\n- **UNAVAILABLE is data.** It means the bounded producer/exporter is absent, stale, or unmatched \u2014 never zero and never success.\n- **Fixture renders are UI contract proof, not live performance evidence.** Promote numbers only from matched, quality-constrained native receipts."
